OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome patchy
OL,6,Flight rain or drizzle will spread east
OL,7,Ffor a time this evening. Then the rest
OL,8,Fof the night will be dry and mostly
OL,9,Fcloudy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMainly dry and cloudy in the
OL,12,Fmorning. Persistent rain, heavy at
OL,13,Ftimes, will extend east across all
OL,14,Fparts in the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,17,FShowers, some heavy and thundery
OL,18,FTuesday. These clear in the east for a
OL,19,Ftime Wednesday. A band of heavy rain
OL,20,Fpushes southeast Wednesday night,
OL,21,Fturning showery Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
